# SIMULATION (model curve), NOT an observation. Gangolli et al. (2025), JCAP 2025(03), 069 (arXiv:2408.08358), Fig. 2 (red dotted): mean free path at 912 A in h^-1 comoving Mpc, z = 4.8-6.5.
#   "Democratic" model: the same ionizing output for every galaxy.
#   FlexRT multi-frequency ray-tracing radiative transfer (200 cMpc/h; haloes from a 3600^3 N-body run) with sub-grid sinks;
#   the emissivity Ndot(z) is an INPUT, tuned for each model to the mean Lya transmission of Bosman et al. (2022; XQR-30) at
#   z = 5-6; h = 0.68.
